@page "/showcase/ai-assistant/admin/audit"
@layout AiAdminLayout

<PageTitle>Audit log · @AiSeedData.ProductName</PageTitle>

@* Admins and the Owner read it: the page's guard keeps prompt editors out, and the state shows the log to those roles only. *@
<div class="container-fluid px-lg-4">
    <AiMemberGuard Require="AiPermission.ViewAudit">
        <div class="mb-3">
            <h1 class="pa-title mb-1">Audit log</h1>
            <p class="pa-lead mb-0">
                Who did what, and when, newest first: invitations, joins, role changes, access removed and restored, ownership transfers, shared prompts created,
                edited, published, unpublished, and deleted, changes to the workspace name, the model policy, retention (and how many conversations it deleted), and the
                spend caps, the demo control's usage, and the sensitive data policy, its events, and their reviews. Chat content and prompt text are never copied here:
                entries name what changed, with lengths and counts, and a sensitive match only masked, like •••• •••• •••• 4242.
            </p>
        </div>

        <section class="pa-panel" aria-labelledby="pa-audit-title">
            <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="pa-audit-title">Entries</h2>
            <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-3">
                <Icon Name="IconName.Lock" class="me-1" aria-hidden="true" />Kept for this browser tab. Entries can't be changed or deleted.
            </p>
            <div class="pa-grid">
                <ShowcaseAuditLog ExportFileName="ai-audit-log" AriaLabel="Audit log of the workspace" />
            </div>
        </section>
    </AiMemberGuard>
</div>
